1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 16=

4
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:14,140
Your Highness.

5
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:15,860
The ground is cold.

6
00:02:19,300 --> 00:02:20,110
Why are you here?

7
00:02:35,620 --> 00:02:36,900
Let me keep you company.

8
00:02:38,460 --> 00:02:39,020
Two people

9
00:02:40,140 --> 00:02:41,140
are warmer than one.

10
00:02:55,550 --> 00:02:57,580
We went through so much to get back.

11
00:03:00,830 --> 00:03:02,070
Chunhua can't die.

12
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:06,390
Can you tell me

13
00:03:07,180 --> 00:03:08,070
what happened?

14
00:03:09,700 --> 00:03:11,300
We fled North Jing.

15
00:03:14,230 --> 00:03:15,830
Only Chunhua and I survived.

16
00:03:20,620 --> 00:03:21,620
The snow

17
00:03:22,070 --> 00:03:22,830
was so heavy.

18
00:03:26,230 --> 00:03:27,110
The road was endless.

19
00:03:30,020 --> 00:03:31,990
However far we walked, it never ended.

20
00:03:33,670 --> 00:03:34,110
Your Highness,

21
00:03:36,270 --> 00:03:37,390
you've left it all behind.

22
00:03:39,620 --> 00:03:40,900
Have I really?

23
00:03:58,180 --> 00:03:58,790
Your Highness,

24
00:04:00,510 --> 00:04:01,830
you're back in Sheng'an now.

25
00:04:05,860 --> 00:04:07,270
It hasn't snowed here yet.

26
00:04:08,420 --> 00:04:09,460
The snow in your heart

27
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:11,860
should melt.

28
00:04:13,140 --> 00:04:14,270
But this moon

29
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:17,620
is exactly like the one

30
00:04:18,710 --> 00:04:19,990
I saw in North Jing.

31
00:04:21,910 --> 00:04:23,380
On those snowy nights,

32
00:04:24,060 --> 00:04:26,060
we often saw a moon just like this.

33
00:04:28,260 --> 00:04:29,820
What Chunhua suffered

34
00:04:31,940 --> 00:04:33,500
was no different from what I did.

35
00:04:43,550 --> 00:04:44,030
Your Highness,

36
00:04:45,990 --> 00:04:47,500
you made it back safely.

37
00:04:49,060 --> 00:04:50,380
Chunhua will be fine, too.

38
00:04:52,620 --> 00:04:52,990
Right.

39
00:04:54,550 --> 00:04:56,150
She'll pull through.

40
00:04:59,260 --> 00:05:00,620
It's just a miscarriage.

41
00:05:03,150 --> 00:05:03,990
I lost

42
00:05:06,590 --> 00:05:07,670
so much blood back then,

43
00:05:09,790 --> 00:05:10,940
but I still survived.

44
00:05:12,030 --> 00:05:12,710
Chunhua

45
00:05:14,150 --> 00:05:15,300
will pull through, too.

46
00:05:18,710 --> 00:05:19,620
(But I don't want to!)

47
00:05:21,670 --> 00:05:23,670
(Even if I get what I want someday,)

48
00:05:25,230 --> 00:05:25,910
(in this life,)

49
00:05:26,620 --> 00:05:28,350
(I won't bind myself to anyone)

50
00:05:29,230 --> 00:05:29,740
(or marry.)

51
00:05:31,380 --> 00:05:32,740
(So that's why.)

52
00:06:01,860 --> 00:06:02,620
You should go back.

53
00:06:03,380 --> 00:06:04,030
I'll stay with you.

54
00:06:05,670 --> 00:06:06,860
We'll wait for Chunhua to wake up.

55
00:06:07,940 --> 00:06:09,790
There's no need for you to stay.

56
00:06:14,710 --> 00:06:15,550
If that's what you wish,

57
00:06:16,590 --> 00:06:17,590
I'll obey.

58
00:06:18,990 --> 00:06:19,910
But there's something

59
00:06:20,990 --> 00:06:21,910
I must say before I go.

60
00:06:26,110 --> 00:06:27,740
Today and every day after,

61
00:06:30,990 --> 00:06:32,470
I want to stay by your side.

62
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:37,670
We'll always stand high here,

63
00:06:39,110 --> 00:06:40,790
gazing out at the city.

64
00:06:52,230 --> 00:06:52,670
Your Highness,

65
00:06:56,350 --> 00:06:57,150
I love you.

66
00:06:58,820 --> 00:06:59,420
Yan Shang,

67
00:07:00,940 --> 00:07:01,990
you scum.

68
00:07:03,590 --> 00:07:05,030
I'm actually starting to believe you.

69
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:06,710
Believe me.

70
00:07:07,940 --> 00:07:08,860
And I believe you, too.

71
00:07:10,230 --> 00:07:10,860
Before,

72
00:07:14,380 --> 00:07:15,860
I never thought

73
00:07:16,910 --> 00:07:19,180
the word "love" meant much.

74
00:07:20,910 --> 00:07:21,910
I never believed

75
00:07:22,710 --> 00:07:23,260
anyone would

76
00:07:24,550 --> 00:07:26,380
give their life for those two words.

77
00:07:27,230 --> 00:07:28,420
It's strange.

78
00:07:28,462 --> 00:07:32,252
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

79
00:07:34,780 --> 00:07:40,670
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

80
00:07:42,180 --> 00:07:42,670
Your Highness,

81
00:07:44,710 --> 00:07:45,350
don't worry.

82
00:07:46,940 --> 00:07:47,620
Don't give up.

83
00:07:49,740 --> 00:07:50,910
So many people care about you.

84
00:07:51,790 --> 00:07:52,500
You're so wonderful.

85
00:07:53,620 --> 00:07:54,820
You deserve all this love.

86
00:07:55,990 --> 00:07:57,670
You're worth risking my life to protect.

87
00:07:59,590 --> 00:08:00,060
So,

88
00:08:01,230 --> 00:08:02,180
whenever it is,

89
00:08:02,430 --> 00:08:03,690
♪Soar with the wind♪

90
00:08:03,740 --> 00:08:04,590
don't worry

91
00:08:05,180 --> 00:08:05,790
or second-guess yourself.

92
00:08:05,970 --> 00:08:07,210
♪Burning bright as a song♪

93
00:08:07,260 --> 00:08:08,300
Just ask,

94
00:08:09,790 --> 00:08:10,860
and I'll tell you.

95
00:08:11,820 --> 00:08:12,300
All right.

96
00:08:13,670 --> 00:08:14,180
I'll ask you.

97
00:08:17,110 --> 00:08:17,910
Why did you

98
00:08:19,500 --> 00:08:20,860
take the blame for me?

99
00:08:21,940 --> 00:08:23,110
Because I love you.

100
00:08:25,590 --> 00:08:25,990
Your Highness.

101
00:08:27,350 --> 00:08:30,920
♪... if you're there♪

102
00:08:31,210 --> 00:08:34,650
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

103
00:08:34,850 --> 00:08:38,310
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

104
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:41,010
♪If we can stay♪

105
00:08:41,060 --> 00:08:45,420
♪Let's return to the village
of our first meeting♪

106
00:08:45,580 --> 00:08:47,790
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

107
00:08:47,790 --> 00:08:50,000
♪- May time be free of pain
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

108
00:08:50,050 --> 00:08:52,510
♪You're the only one I need♪

109
00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:59,850
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

110
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,790
♪Be my one and only in this world♪

111
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,190
♪Be my one and only in this life♪

112
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,780
♪My last untouched innocence♪

113
00:09:19,260 --> 00:09:20,990
The Zheng Xing case is closed?

114
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:22,900
Yes.

115
00:09:23,710 --> 00:09:24,760
The Capital Prefecture,
Justice Ministry,

116
00:09:24,761 --> 00:09:25,990
Court of Judicial Review,
Ministry of Revenue...

117
00:09:26,190 --> 00:09:26,950
all their case files

118
00:09:27,740 --> 00:09:28,380
are here.

119
00:09:30,070 --> 00:09:31,020
Zheng Xing

120
00:09:32,500 --> 00:09:33,990
nearly ruined my grand plan.

121
00:09:34,990 --> 00:09:36,900
What a fool.
His arrogance got him killed.

122
00:09:38,740 --> 00:09:39,990
Sheng'an is a tough place to manage.

123
00:09:40,110 --> 00:09:40,900
I never imagined

124
00:09:41,380 --> 00:09:43,020
that a mere hunting ground

125
00:09:43,590 --> 00:09:45,660
would spark such a war of words.

126
00:09:46,190 --> 00:09:46,590
Zidu,

127
00:09:47,620 --> 00:09:48,540
I'll be counting on you

128
00:09:48,710 --> 00:09:50,540
to handle the hunting ground matter.

129
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:52,660
You can count on me, sir.

130
00:09:53,470 --> 00:09:54,584
But lately,

131
00:09:54,626 --> 00:09:56,596
a bunch of officials
have been at it nonstop,

132
00:09:57,230 --> 00:10:00,020
arguing over Zheng Xing
wounding Prince of Jin.

133
00:10:02,110 --> 00:10:02,780
Officials?

134
00:10:04,350 --> 00:10:06,950
If they didn't argue all day,

135
00:10:08,070 --> 00:10:09,830
what would we pay them for?

136
00:10:12,620 --> 00:10:15,140
The real problem

137
00:10:15,500 --> 00:10:16,540
is that maid.

138
00:10:17,740 --> 00:10:18,540
Take her to the Yintaimen.

139
00:10:19,620 --> 00:10:20,380
Beat her to death.

140
00:10:21,020 --> 00:10:22,470
That should settle the matter.

141
00:10:25,310 --> 00:10:26,230
Rest assured, Your Highness.

142
00:10:27,190 --> 00:10:30,470
Miss Chunhua's pulse is steady.
She's out of danger.

143
00:10:31,070 --> 00:10:33,260
She just needs some rest.

144
00:10:40,900 --> 00:10:42,110
What about the child she's carrying?

145
00:10:45,620 --> 00:10:46,470
Both mother and child

146
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:48,190
are safe.

147
00:10:51,900 --> 00:10:53,660
This... this is strange.

148
00:10:54,140 --> 00:10:57,190
She was beyond saving.

149
00:10:58,140 --> 00:11:00,590
How did she suddenly recover?

150
00:11:03,430 --> 00:11:04,070
Imperial Physician Huang,

151
00:11:06,380 --> 00:11:07,780
you've served here for your whole life.

152
00:11:09,110 --> 00:11:10,470
You know the rules

153
00:11:11,140 --> 00:11:11,740
of the palace.

154
00:11:12,740 --> 00:11:13,430
I do.

155
00:11:14,310 --> 00:11:14,860
I understand.

156
00:11:18,110 --> 00:11:18,740
Imperial Physician Huang,

157
00:11:19,900 --> 00:11:20,860
a healer's heart should be kind.

158
00:11:21,470 --> 00:11:22,710
And the kindest thing

159
00:11:23,190 --> 00:11:24,020
is to keep your mouth shut.

160
00:11:27,260 --> 00:11:28,190
Thank you, Your Highness.

161
00:11:37,590 --> 00:11:37,990
Your Highness,

162
00:11:38,470 --> 00:11:39,660
an attendant from Yintaimen is here.

163
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:45,830
Your Highness,
you'd better settle this soon.

164
00:11:46,860 --> 00:11:48,540
The Investigation Office is swamped.

165
00:11:49,110 --> 00:11:51,470
They'll only wait two more days.

166
00:12:19,700 --> 00:12:24,180
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

167
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:28,660
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

168
00:12:34,660 --> 00:12:36,700
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

169
00:12:45,070 --> 00:12:46,660
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)
Please leave, Your Highness.

170
00:12:46,990 --> 00:12:48,070
Lord Yu is busy today.

171
00:12:48,310 --> 00:12:49,070
He won't see uninvited guests.

172
00:13:00,700 --> 00:13:06,780
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

173
00:13:30,830 --> 00:13:31,380
Your Highness.

174
00:13:33,350 --> 00:13:34,830
Why so quiet now that you're here?

175
00:13:44,020 --> 00:13:45,190
What happened, Your Highness?

176
00:13:46,430 --> 00:13:47,230
You're scaring me.

177
00:13:48,900 --> 00:13:49,500
Chunhua...

178
00:13:54,140 --> 00:13:55,070
Do you want to live?

179
00:14:06,990 --> 00:14:07,620
So,

180
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:11,230
even though I've done nothing wrong,

181
00:14:13,070 --> 00:14:14,190
I'm like a chicken,

182
00:14:15,500 --> 00:14:16,620
like a sheep,

183
00:14:17,990 --> 00:14:19,430
at their mercy to kill,

184
00:14:20,590 --> 00:14:21,830
just to give them an answer.

185
00:14:22,710 --> 00:14:23,310
Yes.

186
00:14:25,260 --> 00:14:26,540
To Yu Cheng'an,

187
00:14:28,860 --> 00:14:30,780
people who've lost homes and land
don't matter.

188
00:14:33,230 --> 00:14:34,780
Court gossip doesn't matter.

189
00:14:36,900 --> 00:14:38,430
Zheng Xing's death doesn't matter.

190
00:14:40,070 --> 00:14:40,660
You and I

191
00:14:42,110 --> 00:14:42,780
don't matter either.

192
00:14:52,260 --> 00:14:52,830
Chunhua,

193
00:14:54,620 --> 00:14:55,780
it's because you're insignificant

194
00:14:57,380 --> 00:14:58,860
that there's still a chance.

195
00:15:00,620 --> 00:15:02,470
Yu Cheng'an doesn't care about you.

196
00:15:03,430 --> 00:15:05,740
Yintaimen couldn't even be bothered
to send anyone.

197
00:15:07,020 --> 00:15:08,190
They've left me to handle it myself.

198
00:15:11,470 --> 00:15:12,470
I've thought of two ways

199
00:15:13,230 --> 00:15:14,500
to keep you out of Yintaimen.

200
00:15:15,950 --> 00:15:17,590
I doubt Yu Cheng'an will make a fuss.

201
00:15:19,590 --> 00:15:20,350
What are they?

202
00:15:23,190 --> 00:15:23,780
The first way:

203
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:25,780
I'll find a way

204
00:15:26,590 --> 00:15:27,660
for Liu Wenji to take you away.

205
00:15:29,950 --> 00:15:30,500
A carriage,

206
00:15:30,990 --> 00:15:32,020
clothes, food, and money...

207
00:15:32,380 --> 00:15:33,190
I'll have it all ready.

208
00:15:33,740 --> 00:15:34,830
You must leave before curfew.

209
00:15:35,660 --> 00:15:36,830
But you can't return to Lingnan.

210
00:15:37,590 --> 00:15:38,500
You'd be better off in the Shu region.

211
00:15:47,540 --> 00:15:47,950
No.

212
00:15:51,110 --> 00:15:53,020
I can't drag him down with me.

213
00:15:58,380 --> 00:15:59,590
What's the second?

214
00:16:11,140 --> 00:16:12,020
Marry Prince of Jin.

215
00:16:13,540 --> 00:16:14,350
That will save your life.

216
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:19,310
Why?

217
00:16:23,590 --> 00:16:24,860
Are you giving up on me?

218
00:16:31,710 --> 00:16:32,310
Chunhua,

219
00:16:34,540 --> 00:16:35,830
now Zheng Xing's death

220
00:16:37,310 --> 00:16:38,710
is blamed on Prince of Jin's injury,

221
00:16:40,190 --> 00:16:41,260
and Yu Cheng'an blames you

222
00:16:42,310 --> 00:16:43,620
for Prince of Jin's injury.

223
00:16:46,430 --> 00:16:48,110
The hunting ground sparked
public outrage.

224
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:49,860
A powerful eunuch died.

225
00:16:50,350 --> 00:16:51,230
A prince was wounded.

226
00:16:52,140 --> 00:16:52,660
And in the end,

227
00:16:53,110 --> 00:16:54,310
it all fell on you.

228
00:16:55,660 --> 00:16:56,540
The officials have made you

229
00:16:57,590 --> 00:16:58,830
the femme fatale behind it all.

230
00:17:03,140 --> 00:17:04,100
We're trapped in a dead end.

231
00:17:05,780 --> 00:17:06,390
For now,

232
00:17:07,950 --> 00:17:09,780
these are the only ways I can think of.

233
00:17:17,580 --> 00:17:18,950
I don't want either.

234
00:17:43,860 --> 00:17:49,140
♪A daughter ventures forth,
in the name her father gave♪

235
00:17:49,950 --> 00:17:56,130
♪Into savage lands,
to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

236
00:17:58,180 --> 00:18:03,580
♪The fate is sealed,
a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

237
00:18:04,860 --> 00:18:07,630
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

238
00:18:07,630 --> 00:18:08,100
Your Highness,

239
00:18:10,710 --> 00:18:11,820
I'm a simple person.

240
00:18:14,340 --> 00:18:15,950
There's a lot I don't understand

241
00:18:16,870 --> 00:18:18,100
or see clearly.

242
00:18:21,780 --> 00:18:23,340
But now, I finally get it.

243
00:18:27,540 --> 00:18:31,580
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

244
00:18:31,710 --> 00:18:32,190
Your Highness...

245
00:18:32,190 --> 00:18:33,960
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

246
00:18:35,150 --> 00:18:36,740
We've suffered too much.

247
00:18:39,580 --> 00:18:41,580
Even if I die, I won't accept this.

248
00:18:41,622 --> 00:18:45,602
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

249
00:18:45,650 --> 00:18:47,800
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

250
00:18:48,060 --> 00:18:48,910
I finally get it.

251
00:18:48,952 --> 00:18:51,592
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

252
00:18:51,740 --> 00:18:52,630
No matter what,

253
00:18:52,672 --> 00:18:53,302
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

254
00:18:53,580 --> 00:18:54,470
however hard it gets,

255
00:18:56,300 --> 00:18:57,580
I'll survive.

256
00:18:59,820 --> 00:19:00,430
I know.

257
00:19:00,472 --> 00:19:02,292
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

258
00:19:02,340 --> 00:19:04,630
Living has always been
the hardest thing.

259
00:19:05,630 --> 00:19:07,100
Always enduring pain,

260
00:19:07,710 --> 00:19:09,540
swallowing your tears
and bearing it all.

261
00:19:09,780 --> 00:19:13,760
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

262
00:19:15,580 --> 00:19:17,230
I ask for nothing else.

263
00:19:17,272 --> 00:19:21,592
♪I'll guard my princess,
and keep her tears at bay♪

264
00:19:22,870 --> 00:19:24,340
Whatever happens,

265
00:19:26,950 --> 00:19:28,470
I'll always be your Chunhua.

266
00:19:31,470 --> 00:19:32,990
Please don't abandon me.

267
00:19:32,990 --> 00:19:35,910
♪You did no wrong, so why this pain?♪

268
00:19:35,910 --> 00:19:36,580
Chunhua.

269
00:19:45,060 --> 00:19:46,500
I'm not abandoning you.

270
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:50,100
You're all I have left.

271
00:19:51,990 --> 00:19:52,950
I'm just

272
00:19:54,710 --> 00:19:55,910
too weak.

273
00:19:55,952 --> 00:19:58,022
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

274
00:19:58,260 --> 00:19:59,740
I failed to protect you.

275
00:19:59,782 --> 00:20:02,492
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

276
00:20:02,540 --> 00:20:04,840
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

277
00:20:05,090 --> 00:20:08,440
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

278
00:20:08,490 --> 00:20:10,180
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

279
00:20:12,360 --> 00:20:16,460
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

280
00:20:16,620 --> 00:20:19,610
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

281
00:20:19,660 --> 00:20:25,890
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers
bright as day for you♪

282
00:20:26,420 --> 00:20:30,290
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

283
00:20:31,390 --> 00:20:32,430
Don't cry, Your Highness.

284
00:20:33,690 --> 00:20:37,690
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

285
00:20:44,780 --> 00:20:46,020
Take me to Prince of Jin's residence.

286
00:20:51,140 --> 00:20:55,500
♪A tooth for a tooth♪

287
00:20:57,040 --> 00:20:59,170
♪A scar for a scar♪

288
00:21:00,460 --> 00:21:02,820
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

289
00:21:05,290 --> 00:21:09,500
♪Mourn the blooms of youth♪

290
00:21:10,780 --> 00:21:13,320
♪Mourn my bridal hair♪

291
00:21:14,360 --> 00:21:16,820
♪Dust veils the way back home♪

292
00:21:21,670 --> 00:21:22,300
Your Highness,

293
00:21:23,580 --> 00:21:25,670
I'm afraid there's nothing I can do.

294
00:21:26,260 --> 00:21:27,910
I can't prescribe anything new.

295
00:21:30,870 --> 00:21:31,470
Then should I keep

296
00:21:32,260 --> 00:21:33,060
taking this medicine?

297
00:21:37,260 --> 00:21:38,910
Forgive my bluntness,

298
00:21:39,670 --> 00:21:41,870
but I'm afraid your impotence

299
00:21:42,470 --> 00:21:43,870
isn't caused by a physical injury,

300
00:21:44,470 --> 00:21:45,630
but by emotional distress.

301
00:21:46,020 --> 00:21:47,630
Medicine can hardly help.

302
00:21:48,950 --> 00:21:50,609
I... I'll take a few more doses.

303
00:21:50,651 --> 00:21:51,841
Please treat me again.

304
00:21:52,870 --> 00:21:55,020
I'm afraid my medical skills fall short.

305
00:21:55,950 --> 00:21:56,540
Perhaps

306
00:21:56,950 --> 00:21:58,230
you should visit
the Imperial Medical Office

307
00:21:59,060 --> 00:22:00,670
for another opinion.

308
00:22:02,340 --> 00:22:03,300
Please forgive me!

309
00:22:03,670 --> 00:22:04,950
I'll take my leave.

310
00:22:05,430 --> 00:22:07,020
Who at the Imperial Medical Office
can help?

311
00:22:07,260 --> 00:22:08,580
Give me a name!

312
00:22:16,910 --> 00:22:17,670
Greetings, Your Highness.

313
00:22:30,500 --> 00:22:32,060
Why take this useless medicine?

314
00:22:35,340 --> 00:22:36,470
Let's try again.

315
00:22:36,990 --> 00:22:37,870
Give it a few more days.

316
00:22:38,230 --> 00:22:39,990
I think you should stop trying.

317
00:22:40,580 --> 00:22:41,780
It's been three years.

318
00:22:42,500 --> 00:22:43,479
Even when you were perfectly healthy,

319
00:22:43,521 --> 00:22:45,041
you couldn't father a child.

320
00:22:45,780 --> 00:22:46,390
And now,

321
00:22:46,740 --> 00:22:48,300
you should focus
on looking after yourself.

322
00:22:53,260 --> 00:22:55,300
I just hate that my father is so blind.

323
00:22:56,100 --> 00:22:58,950
With so many talented officials
and young royals at court,

324
00:22:59,540 --> 00:23:00,740
he weighed all the options,

325
00:23:02,190 --> 00:23:03,540
only to choose you!

326
00:23:04,820 --> 00:23:06,060
I've wasted my whole life for nothing!

327
00:23:08,470 --> 00:23:10,990
Your father wanted you
to marry the Crown Prince,

328
00:23:11,300 --> 00:23:12,950
but he wouldn't marry you.

329
00:23:16,820 --> 00:23:17,780
What did you say?

330
00:23:18,020 --> 00:23:18,870
Still dodging?

331
00:23:19,820 --> 00:23:20,470
Dodge this!

332
00:23:20,990 --> 00:23:21,670
Dodging, are you?

333
00:23:21,910 --> 00:23:23,100
Ow!

334
00:23:24,950 --> 00:23:25,990
It hurts like hell...

335
00:23:26,740 --> 00:23:27,990
Oh, my!

336
00:23:29,500 --> 00:23:30,950
Why did you hit my leg?

337
00:23:32,870 --> 00:23:34,260
(Prince of Jin's Residence)
Should we tell His Highness?

338
00:23:34,540 --> 00:23:35,479
I'm going back to my family home.

339
00:23:35,521 --> 00:23:36,651
Why should I tell him?

340
00:24:16,460 --> 00:24:18,900
(Prince of Jin's Residence)

341
00:24:19,740 --> 00:24:20,990
So what if I can't perform?

342
00:24:24,300 --> 00:24:25,710
I don't care one bit.

343
00:24:35,910 --> 00:24:36,500
Wait, that's not right.

344
00:24:37,300 --> 00:24:38,300
This is great!

345
00:24:40,190 --> 00:24:41,870
Even the Crown Prince won't
dare marry and have children.

346
00:24:42,950 --> 00:24:43,950
Now that I can't perform,

347
00:24:44,740 --> 00:24:45,780
I can't have children either.

348
00:24:47,060 --> 00:24:48,430
Lord Yu will stop keeping tabs on me.

349
00:24:49,950 --> 00:24:51,100
This is great!

350
00:24:51,710 --> 00:24:52,630
Just great!

351
00:25:28,230 --> 00:25:28,780
Your Highness,

352
00:25:29,870 --> 00:25:30,780
does it still hurt?

353
00:25:35,020 --> 00:25:36,540
Chunhua...

354
00:25:40,500 --> 00:25:41,820
You were badly injured,

355
00:25:42,670 --> 00:25:43,780
so I came to visit.

356
00:25:46,820 --> 00:25:48,060
Chunhua!

357
00:25:58,630 --> 00:25:59,300
All right.

358
00:26:00,430 --> 00:26:00,820
Don't cry.

359
00:26:02,390 --> 00:26:02,820
Don't cry.

360
00:26:18,910 --> 00:26:19,870
Stop already!

361
00:26:20,150 --> 00:26:20,929
Quick, get me back!

362
00:26:20,971 --> 00:26:22,081
I-I feel terrible.

363
00:26:22,150 --> 00:26:23,719
(Virtue, Diligence, Joy, and Peace)
My whole body aches...

364
00:26:23,761 --> 00:26:24,561
Mu Ti, don't go.

365
00:26:27,870 --> 00:26:28,740
I came today

366
00:26:29,100 --> 00:26:30,340
not to give you a hard time,

367
00:26:30,910 --> 00:26:32,020
but to congratulate you.

368
00:26:33,950 --> 00:26:35,820
Congratulate me? For what?

369
00:26:37,430 --> 00:26:40,209
Ow!

370
00:26:40,251 --> 00:26:41,211
Congratulations.

371
00:26:42,780 --> 00:26:43,990
Chunhua is pregnant.

372
00:26:46,820 --> 00:26:47,470
Really?

373
00:26:54,780 --> 00:26:55,950
I'm going to be a father!

374
00:26:58,910 --> 00:26:59,990
Am I dreaming?

375
00:27:02,710 --> 00:27:03,150
Ow.

376
00:27:05,100 --> 00:27:05,710
Wanyao,

377
00:27:06,500 --> 00:27:07,929
I'm barely hanging on.

378
00:27:07,971 --> 00:27:09,451
Don't tease me.

379
00:27:11,060 --> 00:27:12,190
It's true.

380
00:27:13,670 --> 00:27:14,580
I came today

381
00:27:15,100 --> 00:27:16,430
to ask you

382
00:27:17,230 --> 00:27:18,740
what you plan to do about Chunhua.

383
00:27:21,100 --> 00:27:22,430
Tell me what to do.

384
00:27:22,820 --> 00:27:23,710
Bring her into your household,

385
00:27:24,060 --> 00:27:24,910
make her a secondary consort,

386
00:27:25,670 --> 00:27:26,820
and record her in the royal registry.

387
00:27:34,260 --> 00:27:35,300
What...

388
00:27:36,430 --> 00:27:38,430
Wh-What now?

389
00:27:38,870 --> 00:27:39,470
Mu Ti,

390
00:27:40,780 --> 00:27:43,470
Chunhua is my most trusted maid.

391
00:27:45,260 --> 00:27:46,710
Take good care of her.

392
00:27:47,260 --> 00:27:48,870
Don't let anything happen to her.

393
00:27:50,430 --> 00:27:51,500
If I find out

394
00:27:52,100 --> 00:27:53,540
you've mistreated her...

395
00:27:54,710 --> 00:27:56,340
You have my word.

396
00:27:57,500 --> 00:28:00,190
I may be useless at everything

397
00:28:00,390 --> 00:28:01,630
and never have enough to eat,

398
00:28:01,870 --> 00:28:02,390
but

399
00:28:02,780 --> 00:28:04,630
I'll take good care

400
00:28:04,990 --> 00:28:06,540
of my woman and child.

401
00:28:14,670 --> 00:28:15,190
Good.

402
00:28:16,580 --> 00:28:18,100
(Virtue, Diligence, Joy, and Peace)
Remember what you said.

403
00:28:19,990 --> 00:28:21,670
If you take good care of her for life,

404
00:28:22,150 --> 00:28:24,630
you'll always be my good brother.

405
00:28:25,500 --> 00:28:25,910
Then...

406
00:28:26,430 --> 00:28:29,020
I'll choose an auspicious date
to marry her.

407
00:28:29,100 --> 00:28:29,910
No need.

408
00:28:30,190 --> 00:28:30,950
It'll be tomorrow.

409
00:28:31,990 --> 00:28:34,390
Come to my place first thing tomorrow
to fetch your bride.

410
00:28:43,340 --> 00:28:44,150
Ow!

411
00:28:44,950 --> 00:28:45,279
(Princess Danyang's Residence)
(Careful.)

412
00:28:45,321 --> 00:28:46,171
(Give him the flower.)

413
00:28:46,230 --> 00:28:46,780
(Give him the flower.)

414
00:28:47,630 --> 00:28:48,540
(Sweep it clean. Look.)

415
00:28:48,950 --> 00:28:49,740
(Sweep it up properly.)

416
00:28:50,540 --> 00:28:51,100
(Watch out.)

417
00:28:51,580 --> 00:28:52,519
(Get that spot swept clean.)

418
00:28:52,561 --> 00:28:53,691
(Tie the flowers tight.)

419
00:28:53,733 --> 00:28:54,123
(Excuse me.)

420
00:28:56,150 --> 00:28:56,950
(A little lower.)

421
00:28:57,430 --> 00:28:58,950
- A wedding here?
- (A little more.)

422
00:28:59,780 --> 00:29:01,390
Is Princess Danyang getting married?

423
00:29:03,340 --> 00:29:04,670
Could it be Yan Shang doesn't know?

424
00:29:07,260 --> 00:29:07,710
A little more.

425
00:29:08,670 --> 00:29:09,060
A little more.

426
00:29:10,260 --> 00:29:10,870
Sir.

427
00:29:16,500 --> 00:29:18,500
You work at the Princess's residence,
don't you?

428
00:29:19,540 --> 00:29:20,540
Do you know Miss Chunhua?

429
00:29:21,230 --> 00:29:22,230
Please tell her

430
00:29:22,500 --> 00:29:23,500
Liu Wenji is here to see her.

431
00:29:25,580 --> 00:29:26,580
Who are you?

432
00:29:27,060 --> 00:29:28,230
Chunhua's getting married tomorrow.

433
00:29:28,470 --> 00:29:29,500
She can't just come out to see anyone.

434
00:29:31,500 --> 00:29:32,190
Tie it tight.

435
00:29:32,390 --> 00:29:32,950
Keep it straight.

436
00:30:07,580 --> 00:30:08,150
Your Highness,

437
00:30:08,950 --> 00:30:09,710
it's cold and damp tonight.

438
00:30:10,150 --> 00:30:10,950
Drinking will only harm you.

439
00:30:17,060 --> 00:30:18,150
Your wounds haven't healed.

440
00:30:20,430 --> 00:30:21,190
You should be resting.

441
00:30:22,100 --> 00:30:22,780
Why are you here?

442
00:30:25,580 --> 00:30:25,950
By the way,

443
00:30:26,470 --> 00:30:27,710
your friend Liu Wenji

444
00:30:28,670 --> 00:30:29,500
has been locked up.

445
00:30:30,500 --> 00:30:31,670
He caused a scene at the gate

446
00:30:31,820 --> 00:30:32,740
and tried to force his way in.

447
00:30:33,540 --> 00:30:35,340
I can't let him ruin Chunhua's wedding.

448
00:30:40,780 --> 00:30:41,870
Knowing Wenji,

449
00:30:42,670 --> 00:30:44,230
if he sees the wedding tomorrow,

450
00:30:44,540 --> 00:30:45,630
he'll only get himself into trouble.

451
00:30:47,340 --> 00:30:49,820
It's the best we can do for now.

452
00:30:51,100 --> 00:30:52,150
I just went to see him.

453
00:30:53,470 --> 00:30:54,150
I had nothing

454
00:30:55,020 --> 00:30:56,190
to say to comfort him.

455
00:30:57,020 --> 00:30:58,020
The way things stand,

456
00:30:59,540 --> 00:31:00,340
our fate is not our own.

457
00:31:02,500 --> 00:31:03,910
There's nothing comforting to say.

458
00:31:05,710 --> 00:31:06,990
How much longer

459
00:31:08,950 --> 00:31:09,870
must our fates

460
00:31:12,820 --> 00:31:14,340
remain in their hands?

461
00:31:21,190 --> 00:31:22,300
These hands of mine

462
00:31:23,820 --> 00:31:25,340
are useless in the end.

463
00:31:46,390 --> 00:31:47,150
Your hands

464
00:31:48,300 --> 00:31:49,630
saved Chunhua's life.

465
00:31:51,020 --> 00:31:51,910
You did the right thing.

466
00:31:53,430 --> 00:31:54,260
I'd have done

467
00:31:56,060 --> 00:31:57,150
the same.

468
00:31:59,950 --> 00:32:00,430
Yan Shang,

469
00:32:03,500 --> 00:32:04,470
all along,

470
00:32:06,100 --> 00:32:07,780
whenever I had to choose between evils,

471
00:32:10,190 --> 00:32:11,390
I always chose

472
00:32:12,950 --> 00:32:14,430
the path that let us survive.

473
00:32:15,990 --> 00:32:17,470
Even if we barely clung to life,

474
00:32:18,340 --> 00:32:19,910
even if we suffered disgrace,

475
00:32:21,500 --> 00:32:22,430
as long as we lived,

476
00:32:24,190 --> 00:32:25,580
we could always turn the tables.

477
00:32:27,780 --> 00:32:28,390
However,

478
00:32:30,500 --> 00:32:31,670
that was my path.

479
00:32:34,150 --> 00:32:34,870
And now,

480
00:32:36,230 --> 00:32:37,780
Chunhua has taken it, too.

481
00:32:45,100 --> 00:32:46,150
Chunhua is just like you.

482
00:32:47,390 --> 00:32:48,630
You're both remarkable women.

483
00:32:51,060 --> 00:32:52,100
Born into this place,

484
00:32:52,430 --> 00:32:53,340
surrounded by thorns,

485
00:32:54,190 --> 00:32:55,580
you two are braver than anyone.

486
00:32:57,470 --> 00:32:58,340
Even if the road to survival

487
00:32:58,950 --> 00:33:00,870
is more painful than death,

488
00:33:02,780 --> 00:33:04,150
she still chose to live.

489
00:33:54,500 --> 00:33:55,020
Chunhua?

490
00:33:57,580 --> 00:33:58,060
Chunhua?

491
00:33:58,540 --> 00:33:59,230
Chunhua, it's you?

492
00:34:01,820 --> 00:34:02,300
Chunhua?

493
00:34:04,100 --> 00:34:04,580
Chunhua?

494
00:34:06,100 --> 00:34:06,500
Chunhua?

495
00:34:07,190 --> 00:34:07,580
Chunhua?

496
00:34:08,350 --> 00:34:08,950
Is that you?

497
00:34:09,180 --> 00:34:09,540
Chunhua?

498
00:34:10,470 --> 00:34:10,950
Wait for me.

499
00:34:15,390 --> 00:34:15,750
Chunhua?

500
00:34:16,500 --> 00:34:16,870
Chunhua?

501
00:34:17,700 --> 00:34:18,500
Is that you, Chunhua?

502
00:34:19,910 --> 00:34:20,310
Chunhua?

503
00:34:21,310 --> 00:34:21,700
Chunhua?

504
00:34:22,140 --> 00:34:23,430
Chunhua, say something!

505
00:34:24,020 --> 00:34:24,430
Chunhua,

506
00:34:24,870 --> 00:34:25,430
is that you?

507
00:34:26,390 --> 00:34:26,790
Chunhua?

508
00:34:27,620 --> 00:34:28,270
Say something.

509
00:34:28,700 --> 00:34:29,100
Chunhua?

510
00:34:29,870 --> 00:34:30,540
Are you there?

511
00:34:31,580 --> 00:34:31,990
Chunhua?

512
00:34:34,830 --> 00:34:35,220
Wait for me.

513
00:34:45,750 --> 00:34:46,140
Chunhua?

514
00:34:46,660 --> 00:34:47,180
Chunhua?

515
00:34:47,750 --> 00:34:48,220
Chunhua?

516
00:34:49,830 --> 00:34:50,950
Chunhua, is that you?

517
00:34:50,950 --> 00:34:51,790
Say something!

518
00:34:55,220 --> 00:34:55,790
Chunhua?

519
00:34:56,700 --> 00:34:58,660
Chunhua, why aren't you saying anything?

520
00:34:58,910 --> 00:34:59,620
Say something!

521
00:34:59,830 --> 00:35:00,870
Are you out there?

522
00:35:01,350 --> 00:35:01,990
Say something!

523
00:35:02,910 --> 00:35:03,540
Tell me

524
00:35:04,500 --> 00:35:05,430
why you're getting married.

525
00:35:05,990 --> 00:35:08,470
Why are you marrying, Chunhua?

526
00:35:11,220 --> 00:35:11,990
Chunhua!

527
00:35:12,350 --> 00:35:13,220
Say something!

528
00:35:13,950 --> 00:35:14,580
Chunhua...

529
00:35:17,660 --> 00:35:18,580
Say something!

530
00:35:19,140 --> 00:35:20,390
What's going on?

531
00:35:20,950 --> 00:35:21,430
Why?

532
00:35:21,870 --> 00:35:22,750
Why are you getting married?

533
00:35:22,990 --> 00:35:23,580
Why?

534
00:35:24,180 --> 00:35:25,390
Wait for me, Chunhua!

535
00:35:26,020 --> 00:35:26,580
Chunhua?

536
00:35:27,430 --> 00:35:28,060
Why?

537
00:35:29,620 --> 00:35:30,180
Chunhua?

538
00:35:31,020 --> 00:35:31,750
Why?

539
00:35:32,390 --> 00:35:33,100
Chunhua?

540
00:35:33,142 --> 00:35:34,872
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

541
00:35:34,920 --> 00:35:37,520
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

542
00:35:37,570 --> 00:35:41,040
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

543
00:35:41,470 --> 00:35:45,630
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

544
00:35:45,860 --> 00:35:49,430
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

545
00:35:49,480 --> 00:35:51,540
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

546
00:35:51,590 --> 00:35:53,980
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

547
00:35:54,030 --> 00:35:56,970
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

548
00:36:05,140 --> 00:36:05,660
Chunhua.

549
00:36:06,910 --> 00:36:07,750
Please, I'm begging you.

550
00:36:10,020 --> 00:36:11,350
Just say something to me.

551
00:36:14,750 --> 00:36:16,100
Won't you forgive me?

552
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:19,700
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

553
00:36:19,750 --> 00:36:21,100
It's all right if you can't forgive me.

554
00:36:21,142 --> 00:36:24,702
♪And break a heart that bears no blame?♪

555
00:36:24,910 --> 00:36:26,100
I just beg you to tell me

556
00:36:27,310 --> 00:36:28,540
why this is happening.

557
00:36:29,190 --> 00:36:32,660
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

558
00:36:33,180 --> 00:36:33,700
Chunhua?

559
00:36:35,580 --> 00:36:36,100
Chunhua?

560
00:36:37,170 --> 00:36:41,300
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

561
00:36:41,430 --> 00:36:41,950
Chunhua?

562
00:36:41,992 --> 00:36:45,725
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

563
00:36:45,767 --> 00:36:50,607
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

564
00:36:51,740 --> 00:36:55,730
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave♪

565
00:36:56,180 --> 00:36:58,770
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

566
00:36:59,640 --> 00:37:01,870
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

567
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:04,190
